---
// Side-by-side Go compiler pipeline vs C++ transitive header cascade.
const W = 900;
const H = 292;
---
<figure class="gfcb">
  <div class="gfcb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison showing C++ re-parsing transitive #include headers per translation unit versus Go reading compact export data once per package through AST, SSA, and native machine code.">
      {/* Top half: Why C++ took 45 min (Header cascade) */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="872" height="92" rx="10" class="gfcb-card is-red" />
      <text x="30" y="39" class="gfcb-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why C++ builds took 45 minutes: transitive #include re-parsing</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao build C++ xưa mất 45 phút: #include kéo lại hàng triệu dòng header</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="30" y="52" width="230" height="40" rx="6" class="gfcb-box" />
      <text x="145" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="gfcb-m">foo.cc + bar.cc + baz.cc</text>
      <line x1="260" y1="72" x2="306" y2="72" class="gfcb-edge" />
      <rect x="306" y="52" width="276" height="40" rx="6" class="gfcb-box" />
      <text x="444" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="gfcb-m">Re-parse STL/headers N times</text>
      <line x1="582" y1="72" x2="628" y2="72" class="gfcb-edge" />
      <rect x="628" y="52" width="242" height="40" rx="6" class="gfcb-box" />
      <text x="749" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="gfcb-b-red">O(N^2) work in pre-header era</text>

      {/* Bottom half: Go acyclic package DAG + export data -> SSA -> Native binary */}
      <rect x="14" y="122" width="872" height="156" rx="10" class="gfcb-card" />
      <text x="30" y="148" class="gfcb-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>How go build compiles linearly: acyclic export data -&gt; SSA -&gt; standalone binary</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cách go build biên dịch tuyến tính: export data -&gt; SSA -&gt; 1 file thực thi tĩnh</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="168" width="182" height="92" rx="6" class="gfcb-box" />
      <text x="121" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="g-b gfcb-b">1. Source &amp; AST</text>
      <text x="42" y="212" class="gfcb-m">cmd/api/*.go</text>
      <text x="42" y="230" class="gfcb-m">Reads direct pkg.a</text>
      <text x="42" y="248" class="gfcb-m">export header only</text>

      <line x1="212" y1="214" x2="246" y2="214" class="gfcb-edge" />

      <rect x="246" y="168" width="192" height="92" rx="6" class="gfcb-box" />
      <text x="342" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="gfcb-b">2. Type Check + Escape</text>
      <text x="258" y="212" class="gfcb-m">-gcflags="-m=2" decides</text>
      <text x="258" y="230" class="gfcb-m">stack frame vs heap</text>
      <text x="258" y="248" class="gfcb-m">allocation at compile time</text>

      <line x1="438" y1="214" x2="472" y2="214" class="gfcb-edge" />

      <rect x="472" y="168" width="188" height="92" rx="6" class="gfcb-box" />
      <text x="566" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="gfcb-b">3. SSA Passes</text>
      <text x="484" y="212" class="gfcb-m">Inlining, bounds elim,</text>
      <text x="484" y="230" class="gfcb-m">dead-code removal,</text>
      <text x="484" y="248" class="gfcb-m">ARM64 / x86-64 codegen</text>

      <line x1="660" y1="214" x2="694" y2="214" class="gfcb-edge" />

      <rect x="694" y="168" width="176" height="92" rx="6" class="gfcb-box is-ok" />
      <text x="782" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="gfcb-b-ok">4. Native ELF / Mach-O</text>
      <text x="706" y="212" class="gfcb-m">+ Go runtime (M:N sched)</text>
      <text x="706" y="230" class="gfcb-m">+ Concurrent GC + .rodata</text>
      <text x="706" y="248" class="gfcb-b-ok">Zero external VM!</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Banning circular imports guarantees an acyclic dependency graph where each compiled package exposes compact binary export data, letting parallel worker cores compile huge repositories in seconds.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cấm tuyệt đối import vòng giúp đồ thị phụ thuộc luôn một chiều: mỗi package sau khi biên dịch nhúng tóm tắt export data gọn nhẹ, để compiler hoàn thành cả triệu dòng code trong vài giây.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gfcb { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gfcb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gfcb svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 680px; height: auto; }
  .gfcb text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gfcb-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gfcb-card.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gfcb-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gfcb-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfcb-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfcb-edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gfcb-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfcb-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfcb-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gfcb-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfcb-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfcb-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gfcb figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
